海之利。地方二千里，持戟百萬，縣隔千里之外，齊得十二焉。故此東西秦也。非親子弟，莫可使王齊矣。」高祖曰：「善。」賜黃金五百斤。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m062-0010","start":10,"end":13,"surface":"楚王信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m062-0016","start":16,"end":17,"surface":"上","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m062-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m062-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"楚王信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m062-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"田肯","kind":"person","person_id":"t2c_9za_jp3","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m062-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m062-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"ofc_8ei_jb7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m062-0217","start":217,"end":219,"surface":"高祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","book_id":"b-shiji-008","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-008","source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu","source":{"title":"史記／卷008","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷008","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷008&oldid=2440965","revision_id":2440965,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"本篇傳世正文91個p區塊，自「高祖，沛豐邑中陽里人」至太史公論贊；不含導覽標題、跨站連結及另署【索隱述贊】的後出文字。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/